WEBVTT

00:20.350 --> 00:24.390
♪ As flowers bloom and wither ♪

00:24.390 --> 00:30.090
♪ May we pass by the magnificent scenery ♪

00:30.980 --> 00:35.140
♪ Contemplate the vastness
of Heaven and Earth ♪

00:35.140 --> 00:40.910
♪ Could it be that both of us
are filled with desolation? ♪

00:41.790 --> 00:45.630
♪ As flowers bloom and wither ♪

00:45.630 --> 00:51.400
♪ May we lead such a life ♪

00:52.350 --> 00:56.520
♪ Contemplate the vastness
of Heaven and Earth ♪

00:56.520 --> 01:01.900
♪ Turning back, you and I ♪

01:05.740 --> 01:07.270
♪ Seize the current moment ♪

01:07.270 --> 01:10.920
♪ The sky is painted
with a gentle pallet of pastel colors ♪

01:10.920 --> 01:15.920
♪ Let's walk together ♪

01:16.360 --> 01:17.970
♪ Even if ♪

01:17.970 --> 01:21.660
♪ The snow in front of us ♪

01:21.680 --> 01:23.170
♪ Will dye our hair white ♪

01:23.170 --> 01:27.210
♪ In an instant ♪

01:27.210 --> 01:28.310
[Joy of Life Season 2]

01:28.310 --> 01:30.780
[Adapted from Mao Ni's Joy of Life
on Weyden Group's Quotidian platform]

01:30.780 --> 01:34.300
[Episode 27]

01:34.560 --> 01:36.119
What are you doing right now?

01:36.280 --> 01:38.180
I have nothing to do anyway.

01:38.200 --> 01:40.739
I'm mixing a new rouge color.

01:40.759 --> 01:42.039
Didn't you bring all these flowers here

01:42.039 --> 01:43.460
to deliver them to Fan Xian?

01:43.480 --> 01:44.800
He didn't want them.

01:46.319 --> 01:47.679
Why don't you take them?

01:48.519 --> 01:49.839
I dare not take them.

01:50.119 --> 01:51.180
I'm here to thank you.

01:51.200 --> 01:52.759
For what?

01:52.800 --> 01:54.320
No matter what,

01:54.440 --> 01:55.700
I didn't want anything to crop up

01:55.720 --> 01:57.919
during Wan'er's wedding.

01:58.480 --> 02:00.800
You didn't tell her
about the secret related to Lin Gong.

02:01.030 --> 02:02.600
That's why I have to thank you.

02:03.039 --> 02:05.590
Aunt, I didn't plan to say it
even if you didn't tell me to do so.

02:06.080 --> 02:08.039
I don't understand, then.

02:08.679 --> 02:10.420
Are you going

02:10.440 --> 02:12.040
to negotiate peace with Fan Xian?

02:13.399 --> 02:14.880
That's not the case.

02:15.480 --> 02:16.720
His Majesty

02:17.080 --> 02:18.180
has great trust in Fan Xian.

02:18.200 --> 02:20.239
Judging from the situation,
he would still let him take over

02:20.239 --> 02:22.799
the Imperial Treasury
even if he doesn't marry Wan'er.

02:24.310 --> 02:26.160
As for the secret related to Lin Gong,

02:26.959 --> 02:29.230
we can only use it
during life-or-death situations.

02:32.559 --> 02:33.670
What's wrong?

02:34.239 --> 02:37.479
Aunt, are you trying
to negotiate peace with Fan Xian?

02:37.920 --> 02:39.959
If that were the case,

02:40.800 --> 02:42.300
there wouldn't be

02:42.320 --> 02:45.079
an extra 20 million tael debt
in the ledger.

02:45.119 --> 02:45.839
But it seems like

02:45.839 --> 02:48.519
the debt was given to him too early.

02:49.720 --> 02:50.480
Everyone in the court

02:50.480 --> 02:52.499
is speculating

02:52.519 --> 02:54.919
that Fan Xian would not
take over the Imperial Treasury.

02:55.160 --> 02:56.359
Continue.

02:56.839 --> 02:58.640
Mr. Fan is enjoying
his success right now.

02:58.640 --> 03:01.560
Why would he need to take over the mess?

03:11.839 --> 03:15.079
That child may look like
a normal person on the surface,

03:15.399 --> 03:16.959
but only I know

03:17.519 --> 03:19.600
that he's as crazy as me on the inside.

03:20.600 --> 03:22.400
I'm in no rush to return to Xinyang.

03:22.439 --> 03:24.199
I'll stay and see

03:24.320 --> 03:25.720
how it'll end up eventually.

03:26.239 --> 03:27.740
When it's necessary,

03:27.760 --> 03:29.799
I'll give him a push from the back.

03:30.959 --> 03:32.379
When it comes to being crazy,

03:32.399 --> 03:33.759
Aunt,

03:34.560 --> 03:36.120
I guess we're on equal terms.

03:43.959 --> 03:44.819
Mr. Fan,

03:44.839 --> 03:46.099
if this doesn't work out,

03:46.119 --> 03:47.519
I still have a private stash.

03:47.519 --> 03:49.120
I'll give you everything I have.

03:49.560 --> 03:50.959
Can you bear to part with it?

03:51.640 --> 03:53.279
Of course not.

03:53.279 --> 03:55.099
But if you feel embarrassed about it,

03:55.119 --> 03:56.200
you can write me an IOU.

03:56.200 --> 03:57.239
We can take it as a loan.

03:57.239 --> 03:58.819
Should we include interest, then?

03:58.839 --> 04:00.239
Interest?

04:00.600 --> 04:02.760
If so, I guess
I'll give you a lower interest rate.

04:03.839 --> 04:06.200
How dare I calculate interest
with you, Mr. Fan?

04:06.200 --> 04:07.210
Wang, it's fine.

04:07.230 --> 04:08.620
I appreciate your intention.

04:08.640 --> 04:09.939
But I don't lack that money.

04:09.959 --> 04:10.499
But Mr. Fan,

04:10.519 --> 04:12.519
I'm trying to share
your burden with you.

04:12.519 --> 04:13.680
Young Master.

04:16.030 --> 04:17.020
Someone outside said

04:17.040 --> 04:18.240
he was to deliver this to you

04:18.260 --> 04:20.080
as per Shopkeeper Ye's instruction.

04:20.100 --> 04:21.820
[Name list of shops]

04:22.360 --> 04:24.719
Shopkeeper Ye is efficient indeed.

04:29.600 --> 04:30.680
Mr. Fan.

04:38.360 --> 04:39.380
Mr. Chen.

04:39.400 --> 04:41.460
You two just came back
from Hall of Joy, right?

04:41.480 --> 04:43.079
You found out already?

04:46.230 --> 04:48.320
You also found out
about his background, right?

04:55.480 --> 04:57.239
Mr. Chen, I...

04:57.239 --> 05:00.099
I've been sick lately.

05:00.119 --> 05:01.199
My ears,

05:01.600 --> 05:03.979
they're failing me all of a sudden.

05:03.999 --> 05:05.079
My eyes,

05:05.160 --> 05:06.480
they're failing me

05:06.600 --> 05:08.020
as well!

05:08.040 --> 05:09.239
I became deaf

05:09.239 --> 05:10.739
and blind out of the blue!

05:10.759 --> 05:11.959
Look!

05:12.319 --> 05:13.079
It's acting up again!

05:13.079 --> 05:14.619
Mr. Chen, look! I can't see now.

05:14.639 --> 05:16.599
Enough already.

05:17.119 --> 05:18.340
Wang Qinian,

05:18.360 --> 05:20.319
regarding Hall of Joy and his identity,

05:20.319 --> 05:23.120
if you dare tell anyone about it...

05:24.600 --> 05:25.619
Understood.

05:25.639 --> 05:27.239
I shall take my leave.

05:27.239 --> 05:30.399
Understood!

05:31.840 --> 05:33.419
I trust Wang.

05:33.439 --> 05:35.079
Why did you try to intimidate him?

05:35.160 --> 05:36.780
You were the one intimidating me.

05:36.800 --> 05:37.659
What did I do?

05:37.679 --> 05:39.680
You're not utilizing
the help of Hall of Joy.

05:39.700 --> 05:41.950
What will you do about
the Imperial Treasury's debt?

05:43.480 --> 05:45.630
So, were you the one who arranged
for Hall of Joy to help me out?

05:45.630 --> 05:46.879
The Imperial Treasury
incurred a huge loss.

05:46.879 --> 05:48.639
How could His Majesty not know about it?

05:49.910 --> 05:51.419
So it was His Majesty's arrangement.

05:51.439 --> 05:53.739
Therefore, the palace can't afford
to fork out the money.

05:53.759 --> 05:55.759
It's the same for
the Ministry of Revenue.

05:55.820 --> 05:57.299
His Majesty had something in reserve.

05:57.319 --> 05:58.959
He wanted to use Hall of Joy

05:58.999 --> 06:02.140
to help you take over
the Imperial Treasury.

06:02.160 --> 06:03.480
It's a huge gift.

06:05.679 --> 06:07.440
But you returned it to him.

06:08.400 --> 06:10.040
However, if we do so,

06:10.040 --> 06:11.920
all the shopkeepers in Hall of Joy

06:11.999 --> 06:13.360
will be done for.

06:14.360 --> 06:15.700
My mother wouldn't

06:15.720 --> 06:17.040
do something like that.

06:17.119 --> 06:18.759
Therefore, I wouldn't do it either.

06:22.910 --> 06:24.520
Your courage is commendable.

06:24.910 --> 06:26.120
It's commendable.

06:27.759 --> 06:29.539
But where will you get the money from?

06:29.559 --> 06:31.360
I have my own way of getting the money.

06:31.439 --> 06:32.340
But before that,

06:32.360 --> 06:35.120
I'll go on a honeymoon trip.

06:37.439 --> 06:38.599
A what?

06:38.870 --> 06:40.000
A honeymoon trip.

06:51.600 --> 06:52.580
Your Majesty,

06:52.600 --> 06:53.920
Fan Xian has arrived.

06:56.800 --> 06:57.780
Your Majesty.

06:57.800 --> 07:00.530
I heard that you'll be
going on a honey...

07:00.550 --> 07:01.380
A honeymoon trip.

07:01.400 --> 07:02.770
I'm here to apply for leave.

07:02.790 --> 07:03.659
Where will you be going?

07:03.679 --> 07:04.419
Mount Cang.

07:04.439 --> 07:05.219
For how long?

07:05.239 --> 07:06.440
I haven't decided yet.

07:06.480 --> 07:08.000
The longer the better.

07:09.600 --> 07:10.619
Your Majesty,

07:10.639 --> 07:11.839
why is that the case?

07:19.239 --> 07:20.719
There's one thing.

07:21.480 --> 07:22.560
I'm afraid

07:27.160 --> 07:29.120
there might be a change of plans.

07:30.250 --> 07:31.859
- Your Majesty, but my marriage...
- Your marriage

07:31.879 --> 07:34.040
has nothing to do with this.

07:35.999 --> 07:38.680
After giving it some thought,

07:40.840 --> 07:42.680
I think you shouldn't

07:42.920 --> 07:45.040
take over the Imperial Treasury.

07:45.759 --> 07:46.920
Your Majesty, you think

07:46.920 --> 07:48.659
I can't fill the 20-million-tael hole?

07:48.679 --> 07:50.700
It's over 20 million taels.

07:50.720 --> 07:53.440
That's not a small sum.

07:53.520 --> 07:55.399
Will you take over Hall of Joy?

07:58.639 --> 08:01.519
If so, there's no way for you
to fill the hole.

08:01.860 --> 08:03.830
The Ministry of Revenue
has run out of money

08:04.160 --> 08:07.219
after our battle against Northern Qi.

08:07.239 --> 08:10.000
Now, there are disasters everywhere.

08:10.079 --> 08:11.739
The money in the Imperial Treasury

08:11.759 --> 08:15.099
isn't used to cover
the deficit of the Ministry of Revenue.

08:15.119 --> 08:18.279
It also serves to relieve disaster
and pacify the people.

08:18.319 --> 08:21.719
Therefore, I think

08:22.119 --> 08:23.360
you shouldn't

08:23.960 --> 08:25.519
jump into the pit.

08:26.160 --> 08:27.380
Fan Xian,

08:27.400 --> 08:28.800
it's time for you to let go.

08:29.319 --> 08:31.000
This isn't child's play.

08:31.360 --> 08:35.059
It implicates all kinds
of national affairs.

08:35.079 --> 08:38.359
And, this is
His Majesty's order as well.

08:38.440 --> 08:39.520
That's right.

08:40.280 --> 08:41.879
This is my order.

08:43.199 --> 08:45.079
If so, all the more reason
I can't let go of it.

08:50.010 --> 08:52.160
Your Majesty, instructing me
to take over the Imperial Treasury

08:52.160 --> 08:53.740
was your order as well.

08:53.760 --> 08:55.319
Your Majesty, your order
represents the truth.

08:55.319 --> 08:56.659
How can it be changed that easily?

08:56.679 --> 09:01.020
If so, how can you acquire
the trust of your subjects and the people?

09:01.040 --> 09:01.980
Therefore,

09:02.000 --> 09:03.640
I'll cover
the Imperial Treasury's deficit.

09:03.640 --> 09:05.500
I'll relieve all the disaster victims.

09:05.520 --> 09:06.939
Your Majesty,

09:06.959 --> 09:09.199
your order shouldn't be changed.

09:11.079 --> 09:12.620
How dare you resist my order?

09:12.640 --> 09:14.839
Your Majesty, I've already
received your order.

09:24.400 --> 09:26.120
If all the disaster victims
were to come here...

09:26.120 --> 09:27.800
I shall present you with my head.

09:36.319 --> 09:37.999
That's an overstatement.

09:38.439 --> 09:39.519
However,

09:39.599 --> 09:41.800
you'll be demoted to a commoner.

09:43.359 --> 09:44.439
No.

09:45.679 --> 09:47.479
You shall be sent to prison.

09:49.040 --> 09:51.719
Your Majesty, thank you for your grace.

09:55.120 --> 09:57.719
I shall take my leave now.

10:02.520 --> 10:05.119
Why don't you think again?

10:21.439 --> 10:24.119
Where did he get
all his confidence from?

10:25.079 --> 10:27.020
Maybe it's from Mount Cang.

10:27.040 --> 10:28.160
Mount Cang?

10:29.439 --> 10:32.839
Maybe Ye Qingmei left behind

10:33.280 --> 10:35.280
a huge fortune for him.

10:40.839 --> 10:43.879
Both she and her son
are eccentric indeed.

11:11.319 --> 11:12.599
Commander Jing,

11:12.640 --> 11:13.740
we meet again.

11:13.760 --> 11:15.280
I'm the deputy commander.

11:18.679 --> 11:19.879
Mr. Fan,

11:20.120 --> 11:21.800
it's our friend.

11:27.400 --> 11:28.740
It's our friend indeed.

11:28.760 --> 11:30.079
Under Mr. Chen's order,

11:30.160 --> 11:32.900
the Black Cavalries are
to escort you to Mount Cang.

11:32.920 --> 11:34.040
Commander Jing.

11:38.470 --> 11:39.850
I'm the deputy commander.

11:39.870 --> 11:41.119
It's the same thing.

11:41.679 --> 11:43.000
Sorry for the trouble.

11:47.199 --> 11:48.359
Let's depart!

11:58.920 --> 12:01.579
We haven't figured out a solution
to the Imperial Treasury's debt yet.

12:01.599 --> 12:03.680
How could you be in the mood for a trip?

12:04.040 --> 12:05.419
The more dire the situation is,

12:05.439 --> 12:07.520
the more we should go on a trip.

12:08.959 --> 12:10.300
Is there a hidden stash in Mount Cang?

12:10.320 --> 12:11.900
There's no hidden stash in Mount Cang.

12:11.920 --> 12:15.520
But I can think of a solution
and attract money to Mount Cang.

12:16.199 --> 12:17.560
How?

12:49.640 --> 12:51.280
Ruoruo, this is bad.

12:51.479 --> 12:53.130
We're surrounded by the Black Cavalries.

12:53.150 --> 12:55.090
Xian is the inspector
of Imperial Inspectorate.

12:55.110 --> 12:56.620
It's normal for them to be here.

12:59.040 --> 13:00.640
So they're here to protect us?

13:04.040 --> 13:05.339
Ruoruo,

13:05.359 --> 13:06.839
how did you become

13:06.839 --> 13:07.939
so strange

13:07.959 --> 13:10.079
ever since Fan Xian appeared?

13:10.559 --> 13:12.819
Initially, you were
the top maiden of the capital.

13:12.839 --> 13:15.459
You recited poems and read books.

13:15.479 --> 13:17.119
What are you doing right now?

13:17.199 --> 13:18.500
Why are you stabbing a toad?

13:18.520 --> 13:20.500
This is a frog.

13:20.520 --> 13:21.319
Isn't it the same?

13:21.319 --> 13:22.419
Why are you stabbing a frog?

13:22.439 --> 13:23.560
What do you know?

13:23.599 --> 13:24.999
We call this dissection.

13:26.120 --> 13:28.660
Ruoruo, must you do it in the carriage?

13:28.680 --> 13:29.970
My hands will only be stable

13:29.990 --> 13:31.720
if I practice this in the carriage.

13:31.870 --> 13:33.800
What's the use
of mastering this skill, then?

13:33.970 --> 13:34.679
Xian taught me this.

13:34.680 --> 13:36.860
He said all medical practitioners
need to master this skill.

13:36.880 --> 13:38.390
Are you trying to be a vet here?

13:39.359 --> 13:41.550
Do not speak
when you're ignorant about the topic.

13:47.479 --> 13:49.119
But Ruoruo,

13:49.400 --> 13:51.920
Xian is something else.

13:52.120 --> 13:53.300
He and Wan'er

13:53.320 --> 13:54.359
are here for a honeymoon trip,

13:54.359 --> 13:55.179
if I'm not mistaken.

13:55.199 --> 13:56.800
Why did he take us with him?

13:58.280 --> 13:59.520
You wish to know why?

14:01.760 --> 14:03.100
If you wish to know,

14:03.120 --> 14:04.560
go and ask him yourself.

14:07.319 --> 14:08.800
Thanks for nothing.

14:11.640 --> 14:13.680
Commander Jing,
please stop for a moment.

14:14.719 --> 14:16.999
Fan Sizhe.

14:17.470 --> 14:18.760
Come to my carriage.

14:19.719 --> 14:20.920
Look at him.

14:31.280 --> 14:32.599
All right. Let's go.

14:38.120 --> 14:39.359
Wan'er.

14:39.520 --> 14:41.280
Why are you pulling a long face?

14:42.040 --> 14:43.319
My return from Northern Qi

14:43.319 --> 14:44.800
is a secret.

14:44.810 --> 14:47.100
But everyone in the world will find out
if he shouts for me like this.

14:47.120 --> 14:48.260
My whereabouts have been exposed.

14:48.280 --> 14:50.620
Do you think you can hide your return
from the Imperial Inspectorate?

14:50.640 --> 14:51.699
There are no outsiders here.

14:51.719 --> 14:52.920
Don't worry.

14:53.240 --> 14:54.819
Is he controlling everything now?

14:54.839 --> 14:56.459
Stop messing around. This is important.

14:56.479 --> 14:57.380
Go ahead.

14:57.400 --> 14:59.800
Do you know why I told you
to come to my carriage?

14:59.920 --> 15:00.860
I don't.

15:00.880 --> 15:03.079
It's because your sister-in-law
is worried about me.

15:03.270 --> 15:04.910
I'll get off the carriage first.

15:05.920 --> 15:07.240
Your sister-in-law is worried about

15:07.240 --> 15:08.419
the Imperial Treasury's deficit.

15:08.439 --> 15:09.699
I have to give her peace of mind, right?

15:09.719 --> 15:10.939
How can I do so?

15:10.959 --> 15:12.479
By employing your help.

15:12.559 --> 15:13.819
Don't use me as your excuse.

15:13.839 --> 15:15.520
You were worried about me.

15:15.959 --> 15:18.299
Didn't you intend to hold an auction

15:18.319 --> 15:19.699
when I was getting married?

15:19.719 --> 15:20.659
Now,

15:20.679 --> 15:23.239
it's your time to shine.

15:23.319 --> 15:24.800
The opportunity was already over.

15:24.810 --> 15:26.839
I wanted to put the guest invitation
up for auction back then.

15:26.840 --> 15:27.800
The wedding is already over.

15:27.800 --> 15:28.580
How can I still hold an auction?

15:28.580 --> 15:29.740
Once we reach the manor in Mount Cang,

15:29.760 --> 15:31.180
you'll be responsible
for arranging the venue

15:31.199 --> 15:32.520
and the procedures.

15:33.040 --> 15:33.780
Sure!

15:33.800 --> 15:35.999
We'll hold another wedding
for you in Mount Cang.

15:36.319 --> 15:37.400
Isn't that extortion?

15:37.400 --> 15:38.339
Don't listen to his nonsense.

15:38.359 --> 15:39.990
Our wedding will only be held once.

15:40.199 --> 15:41.640
This is a name list containing the names

15:41.640 --> 15:42.620
of all shop owners

15:42.640 --> 15:44.239
in the Capital.

15:44.479 --> 15:47.040
Invite them to Mount Cang.

15:50.319 --> 15:51.879
Why should they come?

15:52.040 --> 15:54.280
[Sanjiu Hall]
Yeah. Why should we go there?

15:57.439 --> 15:59.479
I don't understand either.

16:00.040 --> 16:01.879
Why should we go there?

16:01.959 --> 16:05.719
Let's gather at Mount Cang
and admire the beautiful scenery?

16:06.440 --> 16:08.160
[Fan Xian]
He does put it nicely, huh?

16:08.280 --> 16:09.879
I'm sure all of you know

16:09.920 --> 16:11.719
what he's intending to do.

16:12.880 --> 16:15.199
The Imperial Treasury
has a huge deficit.

16:15.359 --> 16:17.479
Everyone in the Capital
knows about that.

16:19.599 --> 16:21.780
A new broom sweeps clean.

16:21.800 --> 16:24.719
Now, he's trying to sweep us.

16:25.400 --> 16:26.699
I'll say the same thing.

16:26.719 --> 16:29.479
Why should we head to Mount Cang?

16:34.520 --> 16:36.940
I caught a cold today.

16:36.960 --> 16:38.790
It's inconvenient for me to travel far.

16:40.040 --> 16:41.780
He's the Immortal Poet.

16:41.800 --> 16:43.260
He's an important official too.

16:43.280 --> 16:45.239
Now that he's inviting us,

16:46.120 --> 16:47.640
all of us have to go.

16:48.240 --> 16:49.819
I'll be honest here.

16:49.839 --> 16:51.599
Even if all of us are included,

16:52.079 --> 16:54.299
do you think
we can gather 20 million taels?

16:54.319 --> 16:55.699
I don't have any money.

16:55.719 --> 16:56.860
Neither do I.

16:56.880 --> 16:58.400
Even if you're penniless,

16:58.439 --> 17:00.599
Mr. Fan just got married not long ago.

17:01.280 --> 17:04.399
We have to give him
a wedding gift somehow.

17:04.440 --> 17:05.520
You're right.

17:06.319 --> 17:07.780
We can go there.

17:07.800 --> 17:09.760
We can prepare
a wedding gift for him as well.

17:10.319 --> 17:12.180
But as for the sum,

17:12.200 --> 17:13.379
that depends on fate.

17:13.399 --> 17:15.639
That's right. We'll only prepare
a wedding gift for him.

17:15.839 --> 17:17.250
We'll prepare nothing else.

17:18.480 --> 17:19.679
Everyone,

17:20.720 --> 17:23.119
I already went
to the Imperial Procuratorate.

17:25.600 --> 17:27.650
All those impartial officials
in the Imperial Procuratorate

17:27.650 --> 17:29.790
were infuriated upon hearing this news.

17:29.810 --> 17:30.859
They said they would submit

17:30.879 --> 17:33.420
a bloody memorial to the throne

17:33.440 --> 17:34.960
and get rid of the crook

17:34.970 --> 17:36.760
if Mr. Fan dares extort money from us.

17:36.960 --> 17:38.780
At least we don't need
to fear him as much now.

17:38.800 --> 17:40.339
We can head to Mount Cang
with peace of mind.

17:40.359 --> 17:41.099
Mister,

17:41.119 --> 17:43.119
you're thoughtful indeed.

17:44.040 --> 17:46.439
Were the officials
in the Imperial Procuratorate

17:46.520 --> 17:48.079
truly infuriated?

17:49.879 --> 17:51.760
They were extremely infuriated.

17:51.839 --> 17:53.760
They even had bloodshot eyes.

17:56.359 --> 17:57.680
Everyone, what do we call this?

17:57.700 --> 17:59.399
We call this a pleasant surprise
from the heavens!

17:59.399 --> 18:00.680
That's right!

18:00.680 --> 18:02.200
[Imperial Procuratorate of Qing State]

18:02.200 --> 18:04.170
Fan Xian has gotten too full of himself.

18:04.190 --> 18:06.180
Now, he's gathering
all the merchants in the Capital

18:06.200 --> 18:08.059
so that he could extort money from them

18:08.079 --> 18:10.700
to cover
the Imperial Treasury's deficit.

18:10.720 --> 18:11.399
That's right.

18:11.399 --> 18:13.780
Fan Xian is vicious and ruthless!

18:13.800 --> 18:14.319
That's right.

18:14.319 --> 18:16.220
This isn't a bad thing.

18:16.240 --> 18:19.020
Fan Xian kept saying
that he would eradicate corruption.

18:19.040 --> 18:20.180
In the end?

18:20.200 --> 18:22.379
He was a corrupt official himself!

18:22.399 --> 18:23.359
That's right!

18:23.359 --> 18:25.200
Serves him right!

18:25.440 --> 18:27.619
Everyone,
once we receive news from Mount Cang,

18:27.639 --> 18:28.899
let's impeach him together!

18:28.919 --> 18:30.440
That's right! Let's impeach him!

18:30.440 --> 18:31.319
We must impeach him!

18:31.319 --> 18:32.579
Impeach him!

18:32.599 --> 18:34.460
We have to work together

18:34.480 --> 18:36.599
and get rid of this corrupt official
for Qing State's sake!

18:36.600 --> 18:37.680
Get rid of him for Qing State's sake!

18:37.680 --> 18:39.000
That's right! Get rid of him!

18:39.000 --> 18:40.879
Get rid of him!

18:40.879 --> 18:41.480
Bottoms up.

18:41.480 --> 18:42.919
Here. Bottoms up.

19:22.559 --> 19:23.399
Clean it thoroughly.

19:23.399 --> 19:24.100
There's dirt on it.

19:24.100 --> 19:26.430
I'll hold you accountable
if our guests have diarrhea.

19:27.240 --> 19:28.130
Chop all of these up.

19:28.150 --> 19:29.520
Chop them thoroughly.

19:30.840 --> 19:32.200
Seems like you're busy.

19:32.440 --> 19:34.560
Xian, you're finally here.

19:34.680 --> 19:35.639
You invited so many guests.

19:35.639 --> 19:36.970
I have to hire people
to feed all of them.

19:36.970 --> 19:38.339
That's why we're busy preparing food.

19:38.359 --> 19:39.899
Not bad at all.
This looks pretty organized.

19:39.919 --> 19:41.919
Come. I have something for you.

19:42.319 --> 19:43.359
Someone named

19:43.359 --> 19:45.520
He Zongwei

19:45.720 --> 19:47.619
told me to deliver this to you.

19:47.639 --> 19:48.440
He said

19:48.440 --> 19:49.399
the Imperial Procuratorate

19:49.399 --> 19:50.490
has their eyes on Mount Cang now.

19:50.490 --> 19:51.730
They said they would
impeach you at any time.

19:51.730 --> 19:52.460
What should we do?

19:52.480 --> 19:53.790
Have you delivered
all of the invitations?

19:53.800 --> 19:54.879
I have.

19:54.879 --> 19:55.599
Those merchants

19:55.599 --> 19:57.099
were planning to move out soon.

19:57.119 --> 19:59.240
I think they'll reach here soon.

20:00.919 --> 20:01.999
Xian.

20:03.079 --> 20:04.619
Be honest with me.

20:04.639 --> 20:06.240
Do you intend to rob them?

20:06.720 --> 20:07.930
That'd make us bandits.

20:07.950 --> 20:09.790
If not, how can
we extort money from them?

20:09.879 --> 20:11.040
We're not extorting money from them.

20:11.040 --> 20:12.930
We'll make them hand their money to us
of their own accord.

20:12.950 --> 20:14.000
It's either they lost their minds

20:14.000 --> 20:15.240
or you lost your mind.

20:16.399 --> 20:17.480
Sit down.

20:18.000 --> 20:18.819
Sizhe,

20:18.839 --> 20:21.819
coincidentally,
you're quite gifted at doing business.

20:21.839 --> 20:23.399
I'll tell you about the things

20:23.399 --> 20:24.360
I've learned.

20:24.380 --> 20:25.379
Tell me if it'll work or not.

20:25.399 --> 20:25.859
It won't.

20:25.879 --> 20:26.899
I haven't even spoken yet.

20:26.919 --> 20:29.439
No matter what it is,
it won't earn you 20 million taels.

20:31.359 --> 20:33.299
Have you ever considered

20:33.319 --> 20:36.119
the meaning of wealth?

20:38.200 --> 20:39.639
I'm sure you've lost your mind.

21:05.200 --> 21:06.180
Shopkeeper Li.

21:06.200 --> 21:07.320
Shopkeeper Wang.

21:07.680 --> 21:08.579
Please.

21:08.599 --> 21:09.619
Shopkeeper Su.

21:09.639 --> 21:10.240
Shopkeeper Wang.

21:10.240 --> 21:10.859
Come.

21:10.879 --> 21:11.379
Come.

21:11.399 --> 21:12.479
- Please.
- Please.

21:12.839 --> 21:13.559
All of them are here.

21:13.559 --> 21:15.000
You all are here.

21:15.079 --> 21:16.680
- Shopkeeper Ma.
- Shopkeeper Liu.

21:16.680 --> 21:17.440
Good morning.

21:17.450 --> 21:18.460
Good morning.

21:18.480 --> 21:19.660
- Please.
- Please.

21:19.680 --> 21:20.399
- Let's go.
- Please.

21:20.399 --> 21:21.479
Come.

21:25.900 --> 21:28.700
[Manor of Mount Cang]

21:28.720 --> 21:30.320
I'm almost done.

21:30.559 --> 21:31.540
It's getting late.

21:31.560 --> 21:32.859
I'll get ready to receive them.

21:32.879 --> 21:33.660
Xian,

21:33.680 --> 21:35.099
do you plan on

21:35.119 --> 21:36.800
telling them that?

21:37.240 --> 21:38.339
What do you think?

21:38.359 --> 21:39.399
This is a new concept.

21:39.399 --> 21:42.320
It's also a redefinition
of the meaning of wealth.

21:43.840 --> 21:45.119
I don't think it'll work.

21:46.000 --> 21:47.680
Did I not express myself clearly?

21:47.680 --> 21:49.240
Or could you not understand me?

21:49.839 --> 21:50.850
You did express it clearly.

21:50.870 --> 21:52.439
I did understand you as well.

21:52.520 --> 21:53.339
It's outstanding

21:53.359 --> 21:54.560
and shocking.

21:54.919 --> 21:55.780
But it won't work.

21:55.800 --> 21:56.660
Why?

21:56.680 --> 21:59.240
Xian, you may understand
the meaning of wealth,

21:59.800 --> 22:01.590
but you don't understand the Capital.

22:01.980 --> 22:03.460
If you tell them about it
in that manner,

22:03.480 --> 22:05.960
I'll make a bet with you
that they won't buy it.

22:06.000 --> 22:06.899
So?

22:06.919 --> 22:08.539
So you may proceed first.

22:08.559 --> 22:09.700
If it doesn't work out,

22:09.720 --> 22:10.660
you can call me.

22:10.680 --> 22:11.879
I'll help you out.

22:13.319 --> 22:14.819
Are you that confident in yourself?

22:14.839 --> 22:15.960
But you have to help me out.

22:15.960 --> 22:17.420
You have to buy me some time.

22:17.440 --> 22:18.180
I have to send my men

22:18.200 --> 22:19.980
back to the Capital to acquire an item.

22:20.000 --> 22:22.020
All right. I can definitely
buy you some time.

22:22.040 --> 22:23.260
But what are you going to acquire?

22:23.280 --> 22:24.760
That's a secret.

22:34.630 --> 22:36.830
- Please, everyone.
- No one should fork out any money.

22:38.000 --> 22:39.180
Everyone,

22:39.200 --> 22:40.490
we must stick to what we agreed before.

22:40.490 --> 22:41.340
No one should fork out any money.

22:41.340 --> 22:42.099
Keep your promises.

22:42.119 --> 22:42.899
Please, everyone.

22:42.919 --> 22:44.040
Please, everyone.

22:44.040 --> 22:44.660
Remember,

22:44.680 --> 22:45.800
stick to what we agreed upon.

22:45.800 --> 22:47.539
- Please, everyone.
- Don't fork out any money.

22:47.559 --> 22:48.299
Everyone,

22:48.319 --> 22:50.679
please stick to what we agreed upon.

22:50.919 --> 22:51.940
You too.

22:51.960 --> 22:53.210
Don't fork out any money. Remember that.

22:53.210 --> 22:54.040
We can give him a wedding gift.

22:54.040 --> 22:55.159
Everyone.

22:57.599 --> 22:59.960
What were you whispering to them?

23:01.119 --> 23:03.059
I told them to stand firm.

23:03.079 --> 23:08.320
If Mr. Fan wants to extort money from us
using his wedding as an excuse,

23:08.390 --> 23:09.899
giving him a wedding gift
will be enough.

23:09.919 --> 23:11.660
He wants money? I don't have any.

23:11.680 --> 23:12.460
Me neither.

23:12.480 --> 23:13.579
All of us don't have any money.

23:13.599 --> 23:14.679
That's right.

23:19.319 --> 23:20.700
What's going on?

23:20.720 --> 23:21.599
Why has the sky grown dark?

23:21.599 --> 23:23.040
What's going on?

23:29.800 --> 23:30.880
He's here.

23:40.919 --> 23:42.040
Hello, everyone.

23:42.110 --> 23:43.480
A pleasure to meet you all.

23:43.760 --> 23:46.159
I am Fan Xian.

23:46.280 --> 23:48.180
I know what you all are thinking.

23:48.200 --> 23:50.439
That's why I'll make a disclaimer first.

23:51.639 --> 23:52.899
My wedding is already over.

23:52.919 --> 23:55.040
I won't be taking
any wedding gifts today.

24:01.119 --> 24:02.200
Of course,

24:02.560 --> 24:04.359
I'm sure all of you are most concerned

24:04.680 --> 24:06.560
about the Imperial Treasury's deficit.

24:06.639 --> 24:08.090
I'll say this first.

24:08.110 --> 24:09.420
Regarding
the Imperial Treasury's deficit,

24:09.440 --> 24:12.040
whether in terms of law or reason,

24:13.159 --> 24:14.800
I should be the one covering it.

24:17.000 --> 24:18.439
If that's the case,

24:18.559 --> 24:20.099
I guess we were worried for nothing.

24:20.119 --> 24:21.579
Think again.

24:21.599 --> 24:23.079
If that were the case,

24:23.319 --> 24:24.740
why would he invite all of us over?

24:24.760 --> 24:25.840
Precisely.

24:26.760 --> 24:27.500
Let's listen to him.

24:27.520 --> 24:29.599
I'm sure you guys are perplexed.

24:29.760 --> 24:30.819
If that's the case,

24:30.839 --> 24:32.720
why did I invite

24:32.720 --> 24:34.260
all of you here?

24:34.280 --> 24:35.220
That's right.

24:35.240 --> 24:36.500
In this world,

24:36.520 --> 24:38.359
every so often,

24:38.399 --> 24:42.159
a miracle beyond its time is born.

24:43.359 --> 24:45.720
Sometimes, it's a person.

24:45.960 --> 24:47.320
Sometimes, it's an object.

24:47.960 --> 24:49.480
Sometimes,

24:50.599 --> 24:53.119
it might even be a concept.

24:53.440 --> 24:54.299
What's a concept?

24:54.319 --> 24:55.619
Concept?

24:55.639 --> 24:58.280
I think it's a kind of thought.

24:58.440 --> 24:59.599
A kind of thought?

25:00.839 --> 25:02.020
Isn't it lucky for us

25:02.040 --> 25:04.859
to be able to witness
the birth of a miracle

25:04.879 --> 25:07.439
while we're still alive?

25:07.520 --> 25:08.940
Therefore, I've invited all of you here

25:08.960 --> 25:10.940
to deliver this fortunate moment

25:10.960 --> 25:13.720
to all of you personally.

25:14.040 --> 25:16.740
All of you will get to witness

25:16.760 --> 25:18.439
the birth of a miracle.

25:20.919 --> 25:22.760
What is he up to again?

25:23.079 --> 25:24.159
Look.

25:24.319 --> 25:25.639
What is he doing?

25:28.040 --> 25:30.359
Wait... What is he doing?

25:33.760 --> 25:35.200
You, great question.

25:35.399 --> 25:37.800
What should we name this miracle?

25:37.839 --> 25:39.359
Who asked him that question?

25:41.919 --> 25:43.200
Please take a look.

25:43.600 --> 25:45.359
[Treasury bonds]

25:45.359 --> 25:49.079
That's right. It's called
a treasury bond.

25:49.200 --> 25:50.879
Treasury bond? What's that?

25:50.879 --> 25:52.280
Treasury bond?

25:52.359 --> 25:53.080
What is that?

25:53.100 --> 25:54.379
Belt? Whose belt?
[*Both sound similar]

25:54.399 --> 25:55.319
What belt?

25:55.319 --> 25:57.099
He said treasury bond.

25:57.119 --> 25:58.379
Doesn't that word represent debt?

25:58.399 --> 26:00.119
It's treasury bond.

26:22.680 --> 26:23.879
We met before this.

26:39.760 --> 26:40.960
Are you Mr. Wuzhu?

26:41.390 --> 26:42.800
Are you looking for Xian?

26:43.000 --> 26:44.180
I'm looking for you.

26:44.200 --> 26:45.619
Me?

26:45.639 --> 26:46.719
That's right.

26:46.839 --> 26:48.919
Right now, everyone is in the main hall.

26:48.919 --> 26:50.520
They're listening to Fan Xian.

26:50.919 --> 26:52.240
The timing is just right.

26:54.280 --> 26:55.360
Everyone,

26:56.480 --> 26:59.679
so, what's the meaning
of a treasury bond?

26:59.960 --> 27:02.240
[Treasury bonds]
As the name implies,

27:02.639 --> 27:04.500
it's a bond of debt

27:04.520 --> 27:06.819
given out by the treasury.

27:06.839 --> 27:08.099
The treasury bond

27:08.119 --> 27:10.439
can be seen as
the Imperial Treasury's debt.

27:11.359 --> 27:12.439
You see?

27:12.520 --> 27:13.280
In the end,

27:13.290 --> 27:14.480
he still came back to the same topic.

27:14.490 --> 27:15.590
He did.

27:16.359 --> 27:17.240
As all of you know,

27:17.240 --> 27:19.299
I own Danbo Bookstore.

27:19.319 --> 27:20.960
I've spent some effort

27:21.040 --> 27:23.560
and printed out
the first batch of treasury bonds.

27:24.399 --> 27:26.040
Each of these bonds

27:26.200 --> 27:28.579
represents a portion
of the Imperial Treasury's debt.

27:28.599 --> 27:30.819
The amounts and terms
vary for each bond.

27:30.839 --> 27:33.280
And these differences
in amounts and terms

27:33.520 --> 27:36.299
correspond
to different corresponding details.

27:36.319 --> 27:37.020
Of course

27:37.040 --> 27:38.379
I won't explain the details

27:38.399 --> 27:39.940
on stage.

27:39.960 --> 27:42.500
They'll be written down
and distributed to all of you.

27:42.520 --> 27:44.679
Let's just talk about
the important points.

27:45.159 --> 27:46.299
With this,

27:46.319 --> 27:48.493
you'll own a portion

27:48.513 --> 27:50.339
of the Imperial Treasury's debt.

27:50.359 --> 27:52.700
What does that mean?

27:52.720 --> 27:54.320
Let's take this bond as an example.

27:54.399 --> 27:56.040
This bond is worth 5,000 taels.

27:56.119 --> 27:58.180
That means you spend 5,000 taels

27:58.200 --> 28:00.420
to become one
of the Imperial Treasury's debtors.

28:00.440 --> 28:01.379
On the surface,

28:01.399 --> 28:03.780
you're paying the debt
on the Imperial Treasury's behalf.

28:03.800 --> 28:06.280
But in reality, you'll get back
your money plus interest

28:06.280 --> 28:08.980
when the Imperial Treasury
makes a profit in the future.

28:09.000 --> 28:10.139
Not just that,

28:10.159 --> 28:12.040
but these bonds are tradable
and can be circulated.

28:12.040 --> 28:13.299
When it's necessary,

28:13.319 --> 28:16.320
it can also be redeemed for cash early
according to the rules.

28:16.680 --> 28:18.099
Everyone knows what's going on.

28:18.119 --> 28:20.319
He's just forcing us
to cover the Imperial Treasury's deficit.

28:20.319 --> 28:21.760
That's right.

28:22.839 --> 28:25.240
All 20 million taels' worth
of bonds are here.

28:25.559 --> 28:26.440
Bids will be accepted.

28:26.450 --> 28:28.030
The one with the highest bid
will make the purchase.

28:28.040 --> 28:29.139
What does that mean?

28:29.159 --> 28:30.859
That means if someone else
offers 6,000 taels

28:30.879 --> 28:31.859
when you offer 5,000 taels,

28:31.879 --> 28:34.110
that person will purchase the bond
instead of you.

28:34.280 --> 28:35.359
That's ruthless of him.

28:35.359 --> 28:37.020
He'll make
more than 20 million taels here.

28:37.040 --> 28:39.099
If so, what's the minimum number of bonds
we need to purchase?

28:39.119 --> 28:40.580
You purchase them of your own accord.

28:40.600 --> 28:42.859
First come, first served.
The sale ends when everything's sold out.

28:42.879 --> 28:43.980
Of our own accord?

28:44.000 --> 28:45.159
Only fools will buy it.

28:45.159 --> 28:46.240
Precisely.

28:48.319 --> 28:50.280
You all may also ask me this question.

28:51.079 --> 28:54.260
"I'm spending money
to purchase these bonds

28:54.280 --> 28:56.240
to cover the Imperial Treasury's debt.

28:56.359 --> 28:58.000
So, what's in it for me?"

29:02.559 --> 29:03.940
To answer that,

29:03.960 --> 29:05.859
we have to answer
the first question I asked you all.

29:05.879 --> 29:07.760
All of you are experienced merchants

29:07.760 --> 29:08.819
who excel at doing business.

29:08.839 --> 29:10.480
I have a question for you all.

29:11.440 --> 29:14.119
What is wealth?

29:22.200 --> 29:24.119
This is wealth.

29:25.000 --> 29:26.679
So wealth consists of silver taels?

29:26.960 --> 29:28.819
Both gold and silver taels are included.

29:28.839 --> 29:29.919
You're wrong.

29:30.520 --> 29:32.740
Gold and silver taels are only tools
for you to measure your wealth.

29:32.760 --> 29:34.240
They aren't wealth itself.

29:34.440 --> 29:35.899
What do you mean by that?

29:35.919 --> 29:38.119
The silver tael
you were holding just now,

29:38.119 --> 29:40.119
it was around one liang, right?

29:40.319 --> 29:41.260
Almost.

29:41.280 --> 29:42.839
How much rice can you buy with it?

29:43.919 --> 29:45.439
Around two dan.

29:45.639 --> 29:48.339
But there will be some fluctuations.

29:48.359 --> 29:51.099
We have to view the prices
in the rice shops every day.

29:51.119 --> 29:51.800
That means

29:51.800 --> 29:53.299
we can buy two dan of rice

29:53.319 --> 29:56.619
with one liang of silver tael
in the Qing State today.

29:56.639 --> 29:59.079
That's the standard of measurement.

29:59.079 --> 30:01.705
Mr. Fan, aren't you
stating the obvious here?

30:01.725 --> 30:02.680
[What is wealth?]

30:02.680 --> 30:04.619
I went to Northern Qi some time ago.

30:04.639 --> 30:05.900
I assume all of you have heard about it.

30:05.900 --> 30:07.540
Mr. Fan, you dominated
Northern Qi with your might.

30:07.540 --> 30:09.859
You are the young hero, am I right?

30:09.879 --> 30:11.040
In Northern Qi,

30:11.040 --> 30:14.040
you can only buy one dan of rice
with one liang of silver tael.

30:14.200 --> 30:15.300
You see?

30:15.793 --> 30:17.379
One liang of silver tael

30:17.399 --> 30:19.940
has different values in Northern Qi

30:19.960 --> 30:21.299
and the Qing State.

30:21.319 --> 30:23.299
Northern Qi was
defeated by the Qing State

30:23.319 --> 30:24.539
during our battle.

30:24.559 --> 30:26.599
Naturally, the price
of their rice would increase.

30:26.599 --> 30:27.679
That's right.

30:28.720 --> 30:30.240
Disasters and wars

30:30.240 --> 30:32.520
will affect the prices
of our commodities.

30:33.319 --> 30:34.879
Why don't you consider this?

30:35.319 --> 30:37.480
What if you all were in Northern Qi now?

30:37.559 --> 30:39.480
How much of your so-called wealth

30:40.000 --> 30:41.299
would be retained, then?

30:41.319 --> 30:44.859
But the Qing State
is flourishing right now.

30:44.879 --> 30:46.180
We don't need to worry about that.

30:46.200 --> 30:47.480
You're right!

31:02.480 --> 31:04.830
I wouldn't even know
about the existence of such a place

31:05.119 --> 31:07.480
had you not brought me here.

31:08.040 --> 31:09.679
I lived here before.

31:09.720 --> 31:11.200
That's why I'm familiar with it.

31:12.000 --> 31:13.030
Why weren't you looking for Xian

31:13.040 --> 31:14.439
this time around?

31:14.639 --> 31:16.000
Do you fear death?

31:16.240 --> 31:17.439
Of course I do.

31:17.900 --> 31:19.970
What if you have to face death
for Fan Xian's sake?

31:20.200 --> 31:21.520
What's wrong with Xian?

31:22.359 --> 31:23.579
I want you to protect him.

31:23.599 --> 31:24.919
Is Xian in danger?

31:25.040 --> 31:26.720
Someone might be trying to kill him.

31:26.800 --> 31:27.859
That's fine.

31:27.879 --> 31:29.339
Xian is a capable martial artist.

31:29.359 --> 31:31.280
Besides, he has bodyguards.

31:31.919 --> 31:32.690
That's useless.

31:32.710 --> 31:34.040
They're not strong enough.

31:34.079 --> 31:35.260
But he has plenty of bodyguards.

31:35.280 --> 31:37.000
The number doesn't make a difference.

31:37.390 --> 31:38.740
Is his assailant that powerful?

31:38.760 --> 31:40.359
Who exactly is trying to kill him?

31:40.559 --> 31:41.639
Me.

31:42.119 --> 31:44.700
The Qing State has flourished
for a long time with peace and stability.

31:44.720 --> 31:48.760
That's the foundation of retaining
the value of the gold and silver taels.

31:48.839 --> 31:50.000
Therefore,

31:50.720 --> 31:53.740
wealth is more than just
gold and silver taels.

31:53.760 --> 31:57.740
It's closely related to
the nation's fortune and strength.

31:57.760 --> 32:01.099
What do you all think
about the nation's fortune, then?

32:01.119 --> 32:03.899
Naturally, the nation is prosperous

32:03.919 --> 32:05.899
with its wise ruler
and intelligent subjects.

32:05.919 --> 32:07.420
That's right.

32:07.440 --> 32:08.560
The nation's fortune and strength

32:08.580 --> 32:10.139
are the very foundation
that sustains wealth

32:10.159 --> 32:13.560
and even continuous growth
in the future.

32:13.670 --> 32:15.379
[National strength
and fortune constitute wealth]

32:15.399 --> 32:16.379
We can see

32:16.399 --> 32:18.619
that the Imperial Treasury
will do well in the future.

32:18.639 --> 32:20.940
You all should look into the future.

32:20.960 --> 32:22.859
What if you possess the treasury bonds?

32:22.879 --> 32:24.200
What does that mean?

32:25.520 --> 32:26.879
That means

32:27.097 --> 32:31.280
you all are long-term investors
who'll never incur any losses.

32:34.000 --> 32:35.919
This is too good to be true.

32:39.399 --> 32:40.420
I think...

32:40.440 --> 32:41.940
Excellent.

32:41.960 --> 32:44.000
Mr. Fan, that was an excellent display.

32:44.240 --> 32:45.460
You... You understood him, right?

32:45.480 --> 32:46.800
I...

32:47.520 --> 32:48.639
I understand.

32:48.919 --> 32:50.980
Mr. Fan, your words

32:51.000 --> 32:52.180
were deafening

32:52.200 --> 32:53.420
and enlightening!

32:53.440 --> 32:54.800
That's right!

32:55.280 --> 32:56.700
Well,

32:56.720 --> 32:58.819
do you all know who Mr. Fan is?

32:58.839 --> 33:01.800
He's an important official of the state.

33:01.919 --> 33:03.300
He's in the Imperial Inspectorate.

33:03.320 --> 33:05.480
And now, he has taken over
the Imperial Treasury.

33:05.559 --> 33:07.420
He already spoke just now.

33:07.440 --> 33:10.020
Don't you all understand
what he's trying to get at?

33:10.040 --> 33:11.200
Mr. Fan,

33:11.559 --> 33:13.280
well...

33:13.320 --> 33:14.960
What was that again? Treasury bond?

33:15.159 --> 33:16.520
I'll pay 200 taels for it.

33:16.680 --> 33:18.839
You can take it as your wedding gift.

33:22.840 --> 33:23.960
Mr. Fan has devoted so much effort

33:23.960 --> 33:26.059
to cover
the Imperial Treasury's deficit.

33:26.079 --> 33:27.060
He has done so much for us.

33:27.080 --> 33:29.859
[Shopkeeper Ma, Capital Merchant]
How dare you give an offer of 200 taels?

33:29.879 --> 33:30.700
Mr. Fan,

33:30.720 --> 33:32.099
I'll fork out 500 taels!

33:32.119 --> 33:33.139
I'll buy it right now.

33:33.159 --> 33:34.879
All of us will buy it, then.

33:35.520 --> 33:37.399
I'll fork out 300 taels!

33:44.710 --> 33:46.980
[Shopkeeper Su, Capital Merchant]
Seems like all of us are excited.

33:47.000 --> 33:48.105
Mr. Fan,

33:48.125 --> 33:49.899
the treasury bond
represents a debt, right?

33:49.919 --> 33:51.740
But you don't need to repay us for it.

33:51.760 --> 33:52.159
Yeah.

33:52.159 --> 33:54.159
You don't need to repay us for it.

33:55.000 --> 33:57.059
I'll fork out 5,000 taels.

33:57.079 --> 33:59.800
What? 5,000 taels?

34:00.079 --> 34:01.679
What is he thinking?

34:08.160 --> 34:09.479
Did you all

34:11.240 --> 34:13.120
not understand
what I was saying just now?

34:13.999 --> 34:15.160
I understand now.

34:15.439 --> 34:17.919
The nation's fortune
is tied to you alone.

34:18.080 --> 34:20.019
Supporting you
is our unquestionable duty.

34:20.039 --> 34:22.640
Mr. Fan, did you
not understand my intention?

34:23.120 --> 34:25.419
I plan to donate
5,000 taels to your cause.

34:25.439 --> 34:27.439
Seems like
they didn't understand me at all.

34:29.800 --> 34:31.839
I need a substitute for the second half.

34:32.160 --> 34:32.860
Wait.

34:32.880 --> 34:34.540
Let me reorganize what you said.

34:34.560 --> 34:36.320
According to what you said,

34:36.359 --> 34:38.220
you lost your memories in Jiangnan

34:38.240 --> 34:39.859
and killed countless people
because of it?

34:39.879 --> 34:40.959
That's about it.

34:41.680 --> 34:43.020
If so, is it possible

34:43.040 --> 34:44.760
that you might not be the culprit?

34:45.600 --> 34:47.000
That's possible as well.

34:47.800 --> 34:49.300
If so, everything's fine, then.

34:49.760 --> 34:51.339
However, if such a person does exist,

34:51.359 --> 34:53.680
he should be as strong as me.

34:55.399 --> 34:56.839
May I ask you a question?

34:57.120 --> 34:58.250
How strong are you?

34:58.270 --> 35:00.120
I can hold my own against a grandmaster.

35:00.640 --> 35:02.100
You want me to protect my brother

35:02.120 --> 35:03.439
and fend off a grandmaster?

35:03.440 --> 35:04.580
I'm not telling you to fend him off.

35:04.600 --> 35:06.030
I'm telling you to kill him.

35:06.080 --> 35:07.700
You have to kill a grandmaster.

35:07.720 --> 35:09.320
Maybe you have to kill me.

35:09.640 --> 35:12.140
Mr. Wuzhu, I don't know
any martial arts.

35:12.160 --> 35:12.979
I know that.

35:12.999 --> 35:15.919
How could a normal person
fight against a grandmaster?

35:15.959 --> 35:17.380
What do people rely on

35:17.400 --> 35:18.600
to change the world?

35:21.200 --> 35:22.399
Courage?

35:23.640 --> 35:24.800
Intelligence?

35:26.439 --> 35:27.519
Beauty?

35:36.519 --> 35:37.879
And tools.

35:44.760 --> 35:46.680
This was meant for my brother.

35:47.519 --> 35:48.999
Why do you have it?

35:49.039 --> 35:50.519
I brought it here.

35:50.720 --> 35:51.800
Did you steal it?

35:52.080 --> 35:53.859
If I can no longer trust myself,

35:53.879 --> 35:57.039
I need someone else
to protect Fan Xian on my behalf.

35:59.600 --> 36:02.800
So the tool inside is
capable of hurting a grandmaster?

36:07.319 --> 36:08.540
Have a seat.

36:08.560 --> 36:10.680
Here, have a seat.

36:16.319 --> 36:17.760
What is he doing on stage?

36:19.479 --> 36:20.600
Everyone,

36:22.120 --> 36:24.359
were the dishes to your liking?

36:24.839 --> 36:26.819
Tell me if you don't like any of them.

36:26.839 --> 36:29.399
I'll tell them to make something else.

36:29.600 --> 36:30.800
Who's that?

36:31.359 --> 36:33.320
I think that's Fan Sizhe.

36:33.479 --> 36:35.780
Wasn't he kicked out of the Capital
due to his crime?

36:35.800 --> 36:37.479
Are you seeking death?

36:37.959 --> 36:39.399
I don't know him.

36:41.160 --> 36:42.230
All right. Just leave it here.

36:42.250 --> 36:43.359
You two may leave.

36:45.319 --> 36:47.479
Firstly, let me introduce myself.

36:47.919 --> 36:48.740
I'm a young merchant

36:48.760 --> 36:49.560
who's fanatical about

36:49.560 --> 36:53.200
doing business.

36:53.399 --> 36:54.580
I heard that all kinds of merchants

36:54.600 --> 36:55.899
would be here today.

36:55.919 --> 36:57.999
A lot of my seniors are here.

36:58.080 --> 36:59.879
Initially, I wanted

36:59.879 --> 37:01.740
to learn from your experiences.

37:01.760 --> 37:03.399
But I never expected

37:03.479 --> 37:04.559
my brother...

37:06.200 --> 37:09.160
I mean, Mr. Fan,
who's famous throughout the state,

37:09.200 --> 37:10.979
to deliver a speech

37:10.999 --> 37:13.640
that has enlightened everyone here.

37:13.839 --> 37:16.660
It serves as a wake-up call.

37:16.680 --> 37:18.399
It was such an excellent speech.

37:18.560 --> 37:20.200
I wonder what Mr. Fan's brain

37:20.200 --> 37:21.560
looks like.

37:21.560 --> 37:22.979
I wonder what's inside.

37:22.999 --> 37:25.280
How did he come up
with all of these ingenious ideas?

37:25.720 --> 37:27.140
During his speech,

37:27.160 --> 37:28.700
he said wealth

37:28.720 --> 37:31.459
was more than
the gold and silver taels we possess.

37:31.479 --> 37:32.620
The nation's fortune

37:32.640 --> 37:33.499
and strength

37:33.519 --> 37:36.939
constitute continuous growth
in the future.

37:36.959 --> 37:38.839
That was such an excellent statement.

37:39.039 --> 37:41.519
We've truly benefited from it.

37:41.640 --> 37:42.499
I think

37:42.519 --> 37:45.060
you all should think about it

37:45.080 --> 37:46.339
and try to study it.

37:46.359 --> 37:50.320
You might discover a new field.

37:50.479 --> 37:53.680
We are already deeply moved

37:53.919 --> 37:55.559
and inspired.

37:56.680 --> 37:57.999
I think you can

37:58.000 --> 37:59.640
experience more of such emotions.

37:59.800 --> 38:00.919
Just now, Mr. Fan

38:00.919 --> 38:02.979
asked you all a question.

38:02.999 --> 38:04.060
If so,

38:04.080 --> 38:06.100
I, a junior,

38:06.120 --> 38:09.479
will be asking you all
a question boldly as well.

38:09.760 --> 38:10.859
Please go ahead.

38:10.879 --> 38:12.080
I'll proceed, then.

38:12.839 --> 38:17.120
Who does
the Imperial Treasury belong to?

38:17.640 --> 38:19.800
Naturally,
it's the imperial family's property.

38:19.919 --> 38:21.060
The imperial family, right?

38:21.080 --> 38:23.399
If so, who owns the money
in the Imperial Treasury?

38:23.399 --> 38:25.100
The imperial family.

38:25.120 --> 38:27.100
If so, the Imperial Treasury's debt...

38:27.120 --> 38:29.379
It will also be
the imperial family's debt, then.

38:29.399 --> 38:30.720
Excellent words.

38:30.919 --> 38:32.580
Everyone, think about it.

38:32.600 --> 38:35.700
If you do purchase the treasury bond,

38:35.720 --> 38:39.720
doesn't that mean you're sharing
the imperial family's burden with them?

38:39.839 --> 38:41.340
To put it nicely,

38:41.360 --> 38:42.700
those who purchase the treasury bonds

38:42.720 --> 38:45.720
will be sharing
His Majesty's burden with him.

38:46.919 --> 38:49.020
This may sound disrespectful.

38:49.040 --> 38:50.960
Please don't tell
anyone else about this.

38:51.439 --> 38:53.600
If you do purchase the treasury bonds,

38:53.999 --> 38:56.580
doesn't that make you
one of His Majesty's debtors?

38:56.600 --> 38:57.839
Am I right?

38:58.359 --> 39:00.200
Please don't tell anyone
that I said that.

39:01.200 --> 39:02.900
Therefore, please think about it.

39:02.920 --> 39:04.339
Once you purchase the treasury bonds,

39:04.359 --> 39:06.260
what would other people think about you

39:06.280 --> 39:07.780
when you do business out there?

39:07.800 --> 39:09.140
Let's talk about the same trade here.

39:09.160 --> 39:10.419
Would you do the trade

39:10.439 --> 39:13.280
with someone with a treasury bond
or someone without a treasury bond?

39:13.479 --> 39:17.720
Therefore, the treasury bond
serves to boost your confidence.

39:19.080 --> 39:20.720
He does have a point.

39:20.760 --> 39:23.320
It does sound interesting
when he puts it as such.

39:24.039 --> 39:26.080
Mister, you're right.

39:26.120 --> 39:29.540
Mr. Fan was the one
who came up with this brilliant idea.

39:29.560 --> 39:32.240
As long as the people exist,
the government will thrive.

39:32.319 --> 39:34.260
I'm sure all of us admire

39:34.280 --> 39:35.919
Mr. Fan's graceful demeanor.

39:38.039 --> 39:42.959
As long as the people exist,
the government will thrive, huh?

39:42.960 --> 39:44.040
That's right.

39:44.410 --> 39:46.240
As long as the people exist,
the government will thrive.

39:46.240 --> 39:47.220
The opposite is true as well.

39:47.240 --> 39:48.620
Are you all worried

39:48.640 --> 39:49.979
that my promise wouldn't count

39:49.999 --> 39:52.240
if I were to be toppled?

39:52.519 --> 39:55.280
Mr. Fan, please resolve our doubts.

39:55.439 --> 39:56.519
Don't ask me that.

39:57.080 --> 39:58.200
Ask him.

39:58.359 --> 40:01.160
He's responsible for the second half.

40:02.319 --> 40:03.339
All right.

40:03.359 --> 40:05.140
That's a good question.

40:05.160 --> 40:06.890
Mr. Fan, your answer was excellent too.

40:06.910 --> 40:08.680
As long as the people exist,
the government will thrive.

40:08.680 --> 40:09.859
The opposite is true as well.

40:09.879 --> 40:11.100
What does that mean?

40:11.120 --> 40:12.600
That means if he's gone,

40:12.680 --> 40:15.140
who will you collect your debt from?

40:15.160 --> 40:16.240
This may not sound pleasant,

40:16.240 --> 40:19.260
but if Mr. Fan
were to be toppled one day,

40:19.280 --> 40:20.899
all of the money
you've invested into the bonds

40:20.919 --> 40:23.039
will go down the drain
as well, am I right?

40:24.479 --> 40:26.080
He's right about that.

40:26.200 --> 40:27.140
Everyone,

40:27.160 --> 40:28.559
don't be anxious.

40:29.160 --> 40:30.160
Please take a look.

40:30.160 --> 40:36.670
[100 Years of Union]

40:36.959 --> 40:38.760
I'm sure you all knew

40:39.240 --> 40:42.359
that His Majesty wrote these four words

40:42.600 --> 40:44.220
and delivered it

40:44.240 --> 40:46.479
to the Fan's Residence

40:46.479 --> 40:47.839
during Mr. Fan's wedding.

40:48.552 --> 40:49.959
I'll ask you this.

40:50.680 --> 40:53.559
Out of all the noble families
in the capital,

40:53.919 --> 40:55.979
which of them has ever received

40:55.999 --> 40:59.160
a plaque with calligraphy
written by His Majesty himself before?

40:59.280 --> 40:59.899
Is there any?

40:59.919 --> 41:00.780
No.

41:00.800 --> 41:02.379
Mr. Fan is the only one.

41:02.399 --> 41:03.419
He's the only one!

41:03.439 --> 41:04.379
Let me ask you this.

41:04.399 --> 41:06.459
How do you read these four words?

41:06.479 --> 41:08.810
100 Years of Union.

41:08.830 --> 41:10.439
What's the meaning of 100 years?

41:10.560 --> 41:11.490
100 years.

41:11.510 --> 41:12.640
It cannot be considered 100 years

41:12.640 --> 41:15.339
even if it's only one year short.

41:15.359 --> 41:16.620
These four words

41:16.640 --> 41:18.459
represent the pact

41:18.479 --> 41:21.600
between His Majesty and Mr. Fan.

41:21.640 --> 41:24.680
It represents His Majesty's trust
in the Fan family.

41:24.800 --> 41:26.299
It's also an opportunity for you all

41:26.319 --> 41:29.019
to ascend to higher ranks in the future.

41:29.039 --> 41:30.740
You should think twice.

41:30.760 --> 41:33.660
This is the only opportunity you'll get.

41:33.680 --> 41:36.939
You might have to wait
until the next century to have a chance

41:36.959 --> 41:39.630
to establish a connection
with the imperial family next time.

41:39.879 --> 41:40.999
Someone,

41:41.280 --> 41:43.479
deliver the plaque
back to the residence.

41:45.830 --> 41:47.160
Thank you all for coming.

41:53.680 --> 41:54.660
Everyone,

41:54.680 --> 41:56.060
we've already said

41:56.080 --> 41:57.519
what we needed to say.

41:57.999 --> 41:58.940
It's getting late.

41:58.960 --> 42:01.559
I'm afraid it's quite late for you
to rush back to the Capital.

42:01.760 --> 42:02.680
You all may

42:02.680 --> 42:04.160
spend the night here if you don't mind.

42:04.160 --> 42:05.959
You can head back tomorrow.

42:06.039 --> 42:07.720
As for the treasury bonds,

42:09.399 --> 42:10.760
I'll keep my promise.

42:11.080 --> 42:12.750
The sale ends
when the treasury bonds are sold out.

42:12.760 --> 42:14.600
You may purchase them
of your own accord.

42:22.959 --> 42:24.280
Wasn't it locked?

42:24.879 --> 42:27.280
It was locked before this.
I unlocked it.

42:28.359 --> 42:29.519
How do I use this?

42:32.319 --> 42:33.879
It lacks a main component.

42:33.919 --> 42:36.439
You'll only get the full item
if you combine them.

42:40.200 --> 42:41.339
Main component?

42:41.359 --> 42:42.640
Combine them?

42:42.879 --> 42:44.839
Why does it sound like a musket?

42:45.200 --> 42:47.260
Mr. Wuzhu, a musket won't do.

42:47.280 --> 42:49.939
It's troublesome, hard to aim,
and inferior to bows and arrows.

42:49.959 --> 42:51.459
I can't damage a grandmaster with this.

42:51.479 --> 42:52.420
You can.

42:52.440 --> 42:54.419
I can't believe
such a hand cannon does exist.

42:54.439 --> 42:55.590
This is different.

42:55.640 --> 42:56.979
Young Lady brought it out.

42:56.999 --> 42:58.019
From where?

42:58.039 --> 42:59.160
Divine Temple.

43:16.260 --> 43:18.260
♪ The youth raises his head ♪

43:18.260 --> 43:22.340
♪ As he moves toward his moon ♪

43:23.860 --> 43:25.980
♪ People tease him for being delusional ♪

43:25.980 --> 43:29.760
♪ Wondering why he is so unconventional ♪

43:31.780 --> 43:35.340
♪ Wearing a white robe
when crossing a muddy pond ♪

43:35.340 --> 43:39.260
♪ How could it remain unstained? ♪

43:39.260 --> 43:41.180
♪ If silver tael has a value ♪

43:41.180 --> 43:44.780
♪ Who can truly be carefree? ♪

43:45.500 --> 43:48.180
♪ All of you are right ♪

43:48.200 --> 43:50.420
♪ He said: "Please" ♪

43:50.420 --> 43:53.480
♪ "Make way" ♪

43:53.500 --> 43:55.980
♪ "Let me drink until I drop" ♪

43:55.980 --> 43:57.900
♪ On the court ♪

43:57.900 --> 44:00.920
♪ I recite several verses ♪

44:00.940 --> 44:03.340
♪ Let me wear a white robe ♪

44:03.340 --> 44:05.420
♪ And cross the alley
filled with insanity ♪

44:05.420 --> 44:08.640
♪ To scoop up the moon's reflection
in the muddy pond ♪

44:08.660 --> 44:10.900
♪ Sirs, please forgive me ♪

44:10.900 --> 44:12.860
♪ Your words of advice ♪

44:12.860 --> 44:15.880
♪ I understand,
but I don't want to pretend ♪

44:15.900 --> 44:18.190
♪ People search for the golden land ♪

44:18.190 --> 44:20.260
♪ While I search for the moon ♪

44:20.260 --> 44:22.720
♪ Why should we travel together? ♪

44:22.740 --> 44:24.660
♪ Thank you ♪

44:24.660 --> 44:26.740
♪ Excuse me ♪

44:26.740 --> 44:28.420
♪ You are you ♪

44:28.420 --> 44:30.320
♪ I am me ♪

44:30.340 --> 44:32.260
♪ Thank you ♪

44:32.260 --> 44:34.220
♪ Excuse me ♪

44:34.220 --> 44:36.020
♪ You are you ♪

44:36.020 --> 44:39.480
♪ I am me ♪

44:51.550 --> 44:54.770
♪ Wearing a white robe
when crossing a muddy pond ♪

44:55.150 --> 44:58.620
♪ Remarkably worldly-wise
yet hopelessly romantic ♪

44:58.870 --> 45:02.010
♪ Know what you love ♪

45:02.200 --> 45:04.770
♪ Don't change ♪

45:06.660 --> 45:10.090
♪ If one has witnessed
both light and shadow ♪

45:10.160 --> 45:13.790
♪ Yet retains their innocence ♪

45:13.810 --> 45:16.840
♪ They shall be cloaked in moonlight ♪

45:16.900 --> 45:20.100
♪ As they journey through the night ♪
